text.section:
The statement of abandonment shall contain:

The name of the domesticating corporation and its jurisdiction of formation;


When the domesticating corporation is a foreign corporation, the name of the domesticated corporation set forth in the articles of domestication;


The date on which the articles of domestication were filed with the Commission;


The date and time on which the Commission's certificate of domestication becomes effective; and


A statement that the domestication is being abandoned in accordance with this section or, when the domesticating corporation is a foreign corporation, a statement that the foreign corporation abandoned the domestication as required by its organic law.
